# SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-or-later
# The `{error: <code>}` codes the API answers (error-codes.sh), one a line: <code> act|moving <what it refuses>.
# `act`: the act or the session's state is refused, so no field is marked and the screen of that act says it.
# `moving`: a value a person typed or chose is refused; it moves to a violation on its field (DomainRule::refused, read
# by refusalsIn) with docs/plans/stable-release.plan.md row S5.38, and leaves this list when its last answer does.
# A new code is a line here, read in review: a field refused is a violation from the start, never a new `moving` line.

# Who is at the screen, and the session
authentication_required act no session: the person signs in first
csrf_token_missing act a write sent without the session's anti-forgery token
csrf_token_invalid act a write sent with an anti-forgery token the session did not give
too_many_attempts act the attempts of a window are spent: wait the seconds it says
step_up_required act the proof of who is at the screen is not recent: give it again
step_up_exhausted act the proof's wrong answers are spent: the sign-in ends
invalid_credentials act the address or the password is wrong, never told which
account_locked act the account is locked after too many wrong answers
account_disabled act the account was deactivated, told only to the right password
session_not_found act the session to end is no longer one of the person's
customer_screen_locked act the customer screen holds this session to itself
platform_operator act an operator's account is not deleted from the account screen
sole_owner act the person is the only owner of companies named beside the code

# Second factors and passkeys
mfa_not_pending act no sign-in waits for a second factor
mfa_already_enrolled act an authenticator is already enrolled
mfa_authenticator_required act the company asks an authenticator, which cannot be taken off
mfa_enrolment_required act the company asks a second factor the person has not set yet
mfa_last_factor act the last factor is never taken off while one is required
totp_not_enrolled act no authenticator is enrolled to confirm or remove
invalid_passkey act the passkey's proof did not verify
passkey_not_found act the passkey named is not one of the person's
passkey_required act this entry asks a passkey the person has not
passkey_sign_in_off act signing in with a passkey alone is switched off
passkey_sign_in_needs_authenticator act a passkey-only sign-in asks an authenticator kept as a way back
passkey_sign_in_needs_passkey act a passkey-only sign-in asks a passkey first
enabled_required act the switch was sent without saying on or off
not_found act the company to prove oneself for is not one the person belongs to
link_not_usable act the reset link is used, expired or never was
invalid_code act the code typed at sign-in or for a company's proof is wrong

# Companies, support and the demo
company_closed act the company is closed: read-only to its members
owner_only act only an owner may do this
not_closed_down act the company to reopen is not closed
reopen_period_over act the company's reopening window is over
support_read_only act support access only reads
support_window moving the hours chosen are not a support window offered: a violation on hours
support_reason moving the reason is too long: a violation on reason
demo_refused act a demo account does not do this
demo_off act the demo is switched off here
demo_busy act every demo is in use: try again in the seconds it says
unknown_country act the demo has no company of that country

# The bin, merges and erasure
no_record act nothing was chosen to remove
record_used act the records named beside the code are in use
removal_final act the removal's day is over: it cannot come back
removal_restored act the removal already came back
merge_undone act the merge was already undone
restore_conflict act what comes back collides with a record made since
merge_into_itself act a record is not merged into itself
merge_cycle act the survivor was itself merged into what it absorbs
merge_conflict act the merge collides with a record made since
merge_alias act a record merged away cannot be a survivor
merge_mismatch act the records to merge are not of one kind
merge_refused act the survivor or the merged-away record is refused, its reason beside
merge_transacted act the record merged away carries documents and stays
no_part moving no part of the data was chosen to erase: a violation on parts
unknown_part moving a part named is not one erased: a violation on parts
erasure_pending act an erasure already waits
erasure_final act the erasure's day is over
erasure_conflict act the erasure collides with a change made since

# Imports
unreadable act the file cannot be read as a spreadsheet
xml_doctype act the spreadsheet declares a document type, refused
unreadable_encoding act the file's characters are in no encoding read
empty act the file holds no row
unknown_columns act the file holds columns the import does not know, named beside
missing_columns act the file lacks columns the import needs, named beside
duplicate_columns act the file names a column twice
too_many_rows act the file holds more rows than an import takes, the limit beside
invalid_pairing act the columns paired do not match the file
import_undone act the import was already taken back
import_final act the import's day is over: it stays

# Texts
invalid_body moving the text sent is not a value and a version: a violation on value
invalid_query moving the texts list's page, size or switches are not ones read: violations on them
unknown_text act the address names no text
language act the language is not one the texts speak
locked act this text is not changed by a company

# The phone paired as a scanner
unknown act the pairing is not one there is
claimed act another phone already took the pairing
expired act the pairing's code expired before a phone took it
ended act the pairing was ended
invalid act the pairing request is malformed (no tab named, or a body the pairing does not read), its detail beside

# Error reports sent by the screens
report_too_large act an error report over the size taken
invalid_report act an error report without its message
